request.description:
Returns all variables in the system as a JSON array.
Each item contains: Name, Min, Max and Units. Name is the full canonical name (free-form since schema v68).
Example items: { "name": "PLC.Temperature", "min": 0, "max": 100, "units": "°C" } or { "name": "IP1_Speed", "min": 0, "max": 1500, "units": "rpm" }
